!Beadeaux (S) header.jpg||
=4 Walkthrough
>**__Note: This special campaign ops is only available when Beadeaux (S) is under the control of Bastok.**__
* Head to {z:Beadeaux (S)} after selecting the mission.
* Obtain a {k:Diamond Seal|Diamond seal} ({p:Key Item}).
** The key item drops off any of the Quadav's in {z:Beadeaux (S)} (excluding NM's).
** It can be obtained when the campaign op isn't flagged, so check that you don't have it before you begin farming it.
** Every member of the party currently in the zone will receive a stone when it drops.
* You will also need a {i:Quadav Charm|Quadav Charm|495} to get to the Qulun Dome area of the zone.
* Make your way to the Qulun Dome area (L-8) on Map 2 and examine the **Ironbound Gate** to enter the battlefield.

=5 Cracking Shells
* Trusts can be summoned and there is no level cap for this battlefield.
* Inside the battlefield, you will face four Quadav NMs.
** {m:Za'Dha Adamantking} ({p:RNG})
** {m:Di'Mho Platekeeper} ({p:WHM})
** {m:Zi'Bhe Gauntletkeeper} ({p:BLM})
** {m:Zo'Bha Helmkeeper} ({p:RDM})
* Only {m:Za'Dha Adamantking} has to be defeated to win the fight.
** {m:Za'Dha Adamantking} will use {p:Eagle Eye Shot}.
** {m:Za'Dha Adamantking} is immune to {s:Sleep}, but nothing else.
* His helpers are much weaker, with no known immunities. They will respawn shortly after they are defeated. The helpers share hate with {m:Za'Dha Adamantking}.
* Once {m:Za'Dha Adamantking} is defeated, an {p:Armoury Crate} will spawn.
* Return to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the mission.

